mdns-bridge is a multicast DNS forwarding daemon developed by
Denny Page.

Unlike traditional mDNS repeaters, mdns-bridge supports
service filtering and interface-specific forwarding policies.

This plugin integrates mdns-bridge into OPNsense by providing:

- Web GUI configuration
- Service management
- Configuration generation
- Interface selection
- Future service filtering controls

The plugin is intended to simplify deployment of multicast DNS
service discovery across segmented networks such as IoT,
Guest, and User VLANs.

